{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_tecno_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_tecno_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"共舞","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tecno_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"fa911a91c75baca7a745227c8670952857d2569a3ecb69e871aba76c452845a8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舞厅老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......实验摇滚，一票......酸性爵士......一票......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舞厅老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......死亡金属，一票。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舞厅老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"昨日重现啊，朋友们，这周舞厅主题日的曲风又没定下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舞厅老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"请你们开始自由辩论吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨里凡！上次看完黑盒演出，你答应我这次会投死亡金属的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我就是更喜欢电子乐的无拘无束，那才是未来之声！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大不了我把票钱退给你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我把新作品卖出去之后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那场震撼人心的表演已在你的灵魂深处留下烙印，区区两张门票的费用能与之相提并论？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"改票。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头雕塑家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"改票是不可能了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头雕塑家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了杜绝私自加票的舞弊行为，老板这次特地嘱咐我用金属材料制作计分板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头雕塑家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是考虑到成本因素，金属板的硬度选得不太对，计票有些费劲，只能用电钻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"*滋滋的电钻声*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，我们是不是应该放弃投票环节了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"机关投票箱、声控计分板、临时外接音频设备，还有试图群体催眠的......手段五花八门，越发可怖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次，“大师”为了让莱塔尼亚乡村民谣胜出，竟然单手接抛十枚至纯源石吸引我们的注意，趁机对计分板动手脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舞厅老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"更可怕的是，他成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头雕塑家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以“大师”的提名权被取消了啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"*滋滋的电钻声*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一票......又只有一票。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在地下城投票的时候是这样，来到这里还是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根本没人懂得欣赏我的艺术品味，真是待不下去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舞厅老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，别生气啊，特克诺，你可是我这舞厅最欢迎的客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舞厅老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"但社区也有自己的规矩，为了调和这帮谁也不服谁的先锋艺术家，我们已经想尽办法啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舞厅老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"无论推荐的曲目是否入选，大家的艺术作品都能在舞厅中免费展示，你的小木偶也在里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舞厅老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，咳，死亡金属确实有些——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"*滋滋的电钻声*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别吵了，雕塑家！等一下再计分！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"*滋滋的电钻声*......克诺......特克诺......醒一醒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你们是存心不想让我的推荐入选了，这回又是谁的把戏？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......已扑灭多处着火点......移除横梁......疑似吸入过多烟尘，暂时昏迷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有没有闻到什么奇怪的味道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......特克诺！你能听到我的声音吗，特克诺？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"该死，我早就警告过你们，舞厅电路排线太乱，不能堆放那么多易燃品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......怪我。我应该替你们处理好那些东西，你们都是好孩子，怎么会舍得扔掉自己的作品。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亚兹......老爹......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，你醒了！医疗人员马上就到，幸好你伤得不重，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡金属......主题日......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少说话，你现在需要休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨里凡......老板......他们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢主持人，我正位于火灾事故现场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"目前消防局已接到报警，但该社区地理位置较为偏僻，救援队无法及时赶到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"火势还在蔓延，社区居民正在自发组织灭火救援行动，接下来就让我们采访一下本次火灾的受害者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我对各位的损失感到十分痛心，请问你知道本次火灾的起因吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是真的“痛心”，那就少说废话，多做点有用的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前社区起火的时候根本没人在乎，连像你们这样的记者也不会来取材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"看来这片社区长期存在消防隐患。频发的火灾、积压的废弃材料......都已经对周边造成了不小影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火灾与我们的作品无关！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们确实没有足够的资金，只能用一些边角料完成创作，但作品里依旧包含了我们充沛的艺术表达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"街头艺术家们对其他民众漠不关心，即便深知其作品毫无价值，依旧以自我为中心，最终酿成这场悲剧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我让你再胡说八道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃......诉诸暴力是他们最后的手段......很难想象这样一群不修边幅的流浪者竟自诩高尚纯粹的“艺术家”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨里凡！停手！他在故意煽动你的情绪，这可是电视台直播。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了？之前的舆论让我们失去了唯一一个好心的赞助商。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但我就是受不了他们这种时候还来说风凉话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板的舞厅刚刚翻修好，墙上的壁画还是我们一笔一笔绘制的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吧台边上那个源石动能装置，掏空了雕塑家两年的积蓄，下个月就能送展了，说不定还会登上《艺论报》......可现在呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......这些街头暴徒，故意将纸板、木料、源石制品等易燃物安置于老化的电路下，在他们看来，这或许是某种呈现“艺术”的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"然而在缺乏统一管理的情况下，这种灾难今后怕是只增不减。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自从这块地皮的收购计划被商人和军方势力搬上台面，我们遭遇的“意外”就越来越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的看不出那个道貌岸然的“记者”是谁派来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我们可以看到，被租户誉为“艺术摇篮”的社区，其实只是遍布消防隐患的烂尾楼群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多方社会人士愿意接手艺术社区的整改工作，为多索雷斯的城市风貌建设添砖加瓦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其中意愿最强烈的便是军方代表......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马特奥上尉，这招可真是太英明了。面对电视台直播的压力，那群混混也不敢做什么出格的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，商人们以为军方代表的脑子里只装了铳械子弹，在收购计划上完全不是他们的对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但论对付艺术社区的这帮刺头，我的经验可比他们丰富得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说得太对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是那名记者办事得力，我们连补偿金都不用出，就能把这些无所事事的流浪汉赶出社区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们看似强硬，内心却极度渴望认同。烧了他们的聚集地之后，我倒要看看，这群人还能玩出什么花样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉真是胆识过人，想必我们收购地皮也是指日可待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这种我行我素、触及道德底线的做法，可能会让更多无辜群众无家可归。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，这里就有一个刚从火灾中心被救出的孩子，让我们来采访一下她的感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，你的爸爸妈妈在哪里？身上的伤口还疼不疼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克制的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......谁......是小朋友......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，不用故作坚强。叔叔们强烈谴责那些衣着恐怖的街头不良分子，现在我们就带你去找家......哎哟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没见过杜林人还好意思在电视台当记者？你叫谁小朋友！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！死小孩你干什么，疼死我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"笨蛋！快把摄影机关了，过来帮我拉开这个疯子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄影师的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好、好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......果然，是群难啃的硬骨头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您说得对。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......个子不大，力气倒是不小。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，这个角度拍不到舞厅内部的情况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你是死脑筋吗？外面拍不到，那就走进去啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"从我们开机到现在，火也烧了几个小时了。舞厅的火势已灭，旁边那两栋住宅楼就没那么好运了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，不过跟我们又有什么关系呢？掌握第一手影像资料可是搏头条的好机会啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚实在不好意思，我们只是想拍两张《社会报》特供的现场照片，拍完就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先将我们被烧毁的作品当作新闻素材吸引眼球，然后再借助不安群众的舆论把我们逼走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"别说得这么难听嘛，各位的作品难得能出现在报纸和电视上吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"这是多好的宣传机会啊，运气好的话，说不定还能一举成名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到自己的心血在各路媒体中一遍遍被焚为灰烬？哪个创作者会默许这种残忍的行为！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"心血？恕我直言，就算是火灾之前，这些“作品”也是彻头彻尾的灾难——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，你根本不懂艺术！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，当然。我只是一名再平凡不过的普通观众，但看客也有评价的权利，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"拙劣的笔触、粗陋的合成效果......这些残次品就算是放到游乐园的惊吓屋里都叫人不敢恭维。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，现在它们似乎还有点“价值”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟按你们这些艺术家的说法，灰烬，不也是美的吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有阻止我取材的资格，请让开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我是否有这个资格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那名独自赶来救火的消防员？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"真是令人钦佩的举动。请收好我的名片，如果你愿意接受独家专访请务必来找我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦借过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现场环境安全还无法得到保证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火灾后需要进行全面的消防检查，避免二次灾害发生。请你配合消防局的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......据我所知，消防局在艺术社区附近可没有安排执勤人员，你这算是擅离职守，消防员先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知，舞厅电路虽然老化严重，但电火花可无法烧出如此平整的切口。你们也来得太及时了，记者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走着瞧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"街灯怎么不亮了......漆黑一片......怪、怪吓人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"都怪那个碍事的消防员拦着。等拍完现场的照片我们就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候铺天盖地都是那些破烂“艺术品”的照片，我看这群暴徒还怎么得意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"舞厅的具体位置在哪儿，我们是不是走错了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黏稠的红色液体......还在往下滴......难、难道是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，用红色颜料画点几何图案就算前卫了？那帮小混混还说我不懂艺术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"艺术不拘泥于形式，而在于调动人类情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"喜悦、悲伤、愤怒、恐惧......欣赏艺术品时会让人不由自主地脱下所有伪装，仅被某种庞大的力量攫夺，身临其境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我看以他们的艺术造诣，是很难达到这个高度的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到您对艺术也这么了解，学习了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"白天的情况你也看到了，那群街头艺术家胡搅蛮缠的劲头好比一场小型天灾，万一被他们逮到了，后果可想而知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经跟台里的人打过招呼，只要录像存储卡送到就能立刻播出。马特奥上尉看到之后，我们就能拿到“好处”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么声音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左边窗内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么晚了，我的眼皮都快磕上了，孩子怎么还不睡啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左边窗内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"亲爱的，耐心一点，他被之前的火灾吓着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧你那点出息，只是一对哄小孩的夫妻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左边窗内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我听舞厅老板说，这次是人为纵火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左边窗内的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太可恨了，你看孩子的头发都被火星子烧焦了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你不会连孩子也怕吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我是说......街角好像站着一个孩子......身上好像还在......发光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可今天晚上没有月亮啊......没有啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师......呜......那是什么东西，为什么看着我们啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怕什么！没看那个东西一动不动的吗？说不定是那些混混丢在这里的废品。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"普通小孩......能跑这么快吗......老师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"实习的，我们先、先离开这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——怎么上班第一天就碰到这种东西啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"没出息的小子......等等我！别把摄影机摔了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真有你的特克诺，你操纵木偶的技术越来越高明了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还得谢谢楼上那对画家夫妇的慷慨配合。舞厅的大火波及了他们养的小羽兽，两人正在气头上呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟敢说我们的作品连惊吓屋里的摆设都不如，我倒要他们看看搞艺术的认真起来能做到什么程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“艺术在于调动情感”？那就见识见识“恐惧”是如何诞生的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨里凡，让大家做好准备，好戏才刚刚开场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......我、我要回家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我爸说过，被火烧死的小孩怨气最重，他一定是来向我们寻仇的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"别瞎说，我们......没做任何亏心事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你精神失常了吗，别笑了！一会儿再把住户吵醒，我们就拍不到照片了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，这是他的笑声......是他来带我们走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的电线不是被烧断了吗，这音效哪儿来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图里翁把健身用的自行车改成了临时发电机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他今晚不准备拿出新作品参与我们的计划了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《奋力蹬车的图里翁》就是他的作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了，他最擅长的是行为艺术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈完了......这里是死路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"振作一点！只不过是装神弄鬼的小把戏，架好你的摄影机，无论如何都要拿到马特奥上尉的报酬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......痛......别躲在我背后，小子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是我啊，老师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......我们背后好像......有人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师&记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"美啊啊啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，控制雕塑头部活动的源石驱动装置改成了风力驱动，不稳定性反倒给这件作品增添了生命力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图里翁也厉害啊，没有他控制自行车的速度，灯光投影的效果不会那么好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他接不接别的发电业务啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头雕塑家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还得感谢那名外行记者关于美的诘问，让我有了新的灵感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头雕塑家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是用舞厅抢救出来的动能装置改造的，我还在光影方面做了一些新的尝试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头雕塑家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下个月的展览我打算用这件雕塑参加，我有预感，这将是一件轰动全会场的作品！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新尝试......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨里凡，你知道，我一直对各种音乐流派都很感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺，我知道，但我现在真的没钱还你那两张门票。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想哪儿去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是，有没有兴趣合作一曲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哪来的声音！为什么感觉有人在我耳边说话，明明没有人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，这个效果器选得不错哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走不出这片社区了......老师......我的脑袋都开始混乱了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是！你仔细听中间那八个小节中的不和谐音，都是我精心编排的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师&记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倒是特克诺你......看不出来啊，还能喊出这样具有压迫感的声音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"前面、前面有光！我们可以逃出去的，让马特奥的酬劳见鬼去吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，很早以前就想试试了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是感兴趣了？过几天带你去听我最喜欢的那支老牌重金属乐队，下次投票你可彻底没有借口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好！那我编曲的时候，你得来当我的人声采样对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那两个人跑哪儿去了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哈......吼......怎么来......我......这儿了......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"实习摄影师","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图里翁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎......人怎么都......晕过去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图里翁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"亲身参与动能和电能的转化过程......果然不易啊......累死我了......特、特克诺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你啦，图里翁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如我所料，把你安排在终点果然是点睛之笔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老兄，你现在这模样也太吓人了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脸色发白，满头大汗，就像刚从湖里捞出来的水鬼......你的衣服呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图里翁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......为艺术......献身......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来怎么办？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......撇开尖叫声不谈，这个年轻摄影师拍得其实还不错啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"社区里的人难得聚在一起设计这场大秀，只有两名观众实在是太可惜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，之前他们是不是说只要录像送到就能立刻播出来着？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺？不去参加庆祝会，一个人坐在台阶上干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到播出后的反响了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒诞、惊悚、娱乐闹剧......什么评价都有，不过这下电视台是不会再找我们麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这不代表我们之后就能高枕无忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有很多人惦记着这块地皮，他们看不到街头艺术作品的价值，只想把我们这些“毫无生产能力的流浪汉”赶出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......今天的庆祝会也是一些人的送行会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来搞艺术就烧钱，还很难获得认可。要是人身安全都没有保障，日子可就难过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座舞厅，什么时候才能再一次营业呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，打扰一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是不是电视台放送的深夜节目里的那群街头艺术家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！可以跟我合个影吗？我和我的朋友们真的特别喜欢那个短片里的作品！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是学艺术的，理论懂得也不多，只能体会到一些情绪，像压抑之后的宣泄和自嘲......说得不对请别见怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......真的喜欢我们的作品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你最喜欢哪一个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"我最喜欢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......怎么突然围过来这么多人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好计分板用的金属熔点高，没被大火烧毁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友们，我们的投票还没结束。推荐的音乐风格比不过你们，我的作品还比不过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我们的作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喜欢混音带的朋友请投第一个和最后一个号码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨里凡","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，电钻给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"酷，这是什么新的互动装置吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头雕塑家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是本人的一些巧思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头雕塑家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺带一提，如果喜欢那件雕塑作品，可以投中间的号码。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
